# --- Compiled example binaries built at the repo root -----------------------
# Go names a binary after its package directory, so `go build ./examples/Foo`
# run from the repo root leaves "Foo" here rather than under examples/. They
# have no extension, and no glob can distinguish an extensionless binary from
# an extensionless source file -- Makefile and NOTICE live at this root -- so
# they are listed by name.
#
# Prefer `go build -o _build/ ./examples/...`, which sidesteps this entirely:
# _build/ is already ignored above, and nothing new needs adding here when an
# example is added.
/Attentional-Blink
/Hemispheric-differences-word-processing
/Memory-Iconic-Sperling
/Perception-of-Temporal-Patterns
/RSVP-Images
/RSVP-Images-OneBack
/Trubutschek_Unconscious_Working_Memory
/demo_simple_audio_visual_stim
/examples/Rush-Hour/Rush-Hour

# --- Editor and session leftovers -------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
# Crash artefacts from an interrupted save. paper/*.bbl and *.bcf are ignored
# above, but the suffix defeats those patterns.
paper/*-SAVE-ERROR

# --- Data produced by running the examples ----------------------------------
# Recordings from a test run of picture_naming: output, not input.
examples/picture_naming/sub-*.wav

# --- Not for a public repository --------------------------------------------
